inconsistent reporting.
Unique Identifiers

The distinction between:

UIDs (system-unique),
UUIDs (globally unique),

was introduced.

Why They Matter

Unique identifiers:

prevent duplication,
support entity matching,
improve integration,
maintain referential consistency.
